; status: errors — Kawasaki. Diagonal a–c plus the vertical midline meet at the
; centre with sectors 45/135/45/135; alternating sums 90 vs 270, so the vertex
; is not flat-foldable regardless of the M/V marks.

paper square

--ac = map .b onto .d     ; diagonal a–c
--v  = map .a onto .b     ; vertical midline x = 1/2

@collapse --ac & .a and --ac & .c
  and --v & --cd and --v & --ab
